    "sourcePath": "测试文档/fixture-d-goal-plan-task-state-model.md",
    "role": "target",
    "scope": {
      "text": "本文档是规划域 F40 的 target data model contract：定义 Goal / UserProfile / PlanBundle(Plan+Stage[]+Task[]) 目标核心链、planner 临时输入与执行事实的归属、DailyPlan[] 的 legacy 边界与迁移方向；改动 models/、planner、replanner、storage 或页面数据消费前以本文档为 source of truth。",
      "sectionRefs": [
        "§Purpose"
      ]
    },
    "nonGoalSummary": {
      "text": "F40 只做模型与迁移方向评审：不删除 DailyPlan[]、不改 daily-plans:{goalId} 存储键、不改兼容读取与 adapter、不实现 AI 或 planner 重写；F41 只在纯 models/ 层实现目标新增；扩展字段、DeepSeek/replanner schema、确定性 planner 改造、消费者迁移与破坏性删除均留作后续特性，不属于本文档。",
      "sectionRefs": [
        "§Purpose",
        "§DailyPlan legacy boundary",
        "§Migration direction"
      ]
    }
  },
  "thesis": "目标规划域把 Goal / UserProfile / PlanBundle(Plan+Stage[]+Task[]) 定为持久真相，把 planner 输入与计算视图排除在真相之外，并把 DailyPlan[] 降为迁移期兼容面。",
